[en.CHARACTER_LIMESTONE_PIE_NAME]
Limestone Pie

[en.CHARACTER_LIMESTONE_PIE_DESC]
As the eldest of the Pie sisters, Limestone Pie had shouldered the responsibility of caring for her parents and sisters, as well as managing the farm, from the moment she was born. This upbringing shaped her into a fiery and unpredictable character. However, beneath her always-angry demeanor lay a heart that unconditionally loved her family members and the farm. If given the choice, she would gladly trade her life to bring back her mischievous sister, Pinkie Pie.
After the Last Roundup, Limestone Pie willingly handed over control of the autonomy to her more popular sister, Maud Pie. However, she still kept a close watch over every aspect of the land, secretly vowing to make Empress Cozy Glow and her lackeys pay a painful price one day.

[zh.CHARACTER_LIMESTONE_PIE_NAME]
石青派

[zh.CHARACTER_LIMESTONE_PIE_DESC]
作为派家族四姐妹的大姐，自出生开始，石青派就抗下了照顾父母和姐妹以及照料农场的重任，这让她养成了十分火爆和难以捉摸的性格，但在她总是怒气冲冲的脸庞下面，是对她家族成员和农场永远无条件付出和热爱的心。如果让她选择，她宁愿付出她的生命来换回她那古灵精怪的妹妹萍琪·派。
终末之战后，石青派主动将自治领的主导权交给了更受小马欢迎的妹妹石灰派，但她仍然紧盯着这块土地上的方方面面，暗中发誓终有一天要让友谊女皇和她的走狗付出惨痛代价。
